@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName "Noto Sans CJK TC"
skinparam dpi 150
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam maxMessageSize 285
skinparam ParticipantPadding 10
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #F8FAFC
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #334155
skinparam SequenceLifeLineBorderColor #64748B
skinparam SequenceArrowColor #1E293B
skinparam SequenceGroupBorderColor #64748B
skinparam SequenceGroupHeaderFontColor #0F172A
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFFDE7
skinparam NoteBorderColor #D97706

autonumber
participant "消費端 App\n(Article / ContentObserver)" as Client
participant "ContentService\n(ObserverNode /\nObserverCollector)" as CS
participant "提供端 App\n(ArticlesProvider)" as Provider

group #EFF6FF 1. 註冊內容觀察者：registerContentObserver
  Client -> Client : ContentResolver.registerContentObserver(uri, true, observer)\n剝離 userId + observer.getContentObserver() 建 Transport (IContentObserver.Stub)
  Client -> CS : IContentService.registerContentObserver(uri, true, Transport, userHandle, sdkVer)
  CS -> CS : handleIncomingUser(FLAG_GRANT_READ_URI_PERMISSION)\n+ ActivityManagerInternal.checkContentProviderAccess() [API 26+ 越權拋 SecurityException]
  CS -> CS : synchronized(mRootNode) -> mRootNode.addObserverLocked()\n依 authority 與 path segments 建 URI 前綴樹\n建立 ObserverEntry 並透過 sObserverDeathDispatcher 登記死亡清理
end

group #F0FDF4 2. 批次發送更新通知：notifyChange
  Provider -> Provider : ArticlesProvider.insert() 寫入新資料\n-> ContentResolver.notifyChange(uris, observer, flags)\n按 userId 分群打包為 Uri[] 陣列
  Provider -> CS : IContentService.notifyChange(uris[], observer, self, flags, userId, sdkVer, pkg)
  CS -> CS : 逐 URI 驗證 checkContentProviderAccess()
  CS -> CS : synchronized(mRootNode) -> mRootNode.collectObserversLocked()\n① 祖先節點：僅收集 notifyForDescendants==true\n② 葉節點＋全體子樹節點：依 userHandle/selfChange 收集\n匯入 ObserverCollector 按 (observer, uid, self, flags, userId) 合併 Uri[]
  CS -> CS : ObserverCollector.dispatch()：\n查詢 getUidProcessState(uid)
  alt 前景重要進程 (<= IMPORTANT_FOREGROUND) 或 NOTIFY_NO_DELAY
    CS -> Client : 立即送出 oneway IContentObserver.onChangeEtc(self, uris[], flags, userId)
  else 背景進程（防驚群 Stampeding）
    CS -> Client : BackgroundThread.postDelayed(10s)\n-> oneway IContentObserver.onChangeEtc(self, uris[], flags, userId)
  end
  opt 帶 NOTIFY_SYNC_TO_NETWORK
    CS -> CS : SyncManager.scheduleLocalSync() + invalidateCacheLocked()
  end
end

group #FEF3C7 3. 消費端接收並切執行緒回調
  Client -> Client : Transport.onChangeEtc() -> ContentObserver.dispatchChange()\n[ExecutorContentObserver -> mExecutor.execute()\n / Handler -> mHandler.post() / null -> 直接執行]
  Client -> Client : ArticleObserver.onChange(selfChange, uris, flags, userId)\n向下相容轉呼 onChange(selfChange, uri) 刷新 UI
end
@enduml
